    <h1>Actors are not lambdas</h1>
    <LogPrompt prompt={prompt} label="The design question" headingTag="span" />
    <div class="log-entry-meta"><span>Authored by <strong>Alex Mills</strong></span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><time datetime="2026-10-16">October 16, 2026</time></div>
    <p class="log-entry-intro">An actor can do the work of a short-lived function, or it can own a living application. Stateless and stateful are choices; the actor boundary is the constant.</p>
